    "body": "Can you tweak to say\n\n\"does not wrap (i.e. repeat the same time value) for at least 24 hours\"\n\nI want to make it clear that \"wrap\" is not the same as timer roll-over.  The time CSR can be any value when the trace starts, and one roll-over is allowed but multiple roll-overs are not",
